emergencyRescue
function emergencyRescue(
    address token,
    address to,
    uint256 amount
) public override onlyOwner
Allows the vault owner to rescue an arbitrary 
amount
 of an ERC-20 
token
 that was mistakenly sent to the vault, transferring it to the 
to
 address. This function cannot be used to rescue the AToken that the vault is designed to hold.

Input Parameters:
Name
Type
Description
token
address
The address of the ERC-20 token to rescue. Cannot be the vault's AToken.
to
address
The address to which the rescued tokens will be sent.
amount
uint256
The amount of tokens to rescue.
